1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Accepted local browser and Mac evidence. Captions and original soundtrack; no narration.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The accepted browser runtime renders Jizan Corridor in isometric mode.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Classic uses square terrain and coordinates in the same local browser build.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The native selector offers faction language or English within the same voice families.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
A native deploy proposal is reviewed before the player explicitly applies that order.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The deploy completed once. The resulting construction yard survived save and reload.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Classic Jizan restores its native objective state. Human campaign balance review remains pending.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Off stopped the companion sidecar. Manual gameplay remained available.

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Manual movement continued after Off. The inherited HUD shortcut hint remains visible.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
macOS 15+ candidate. ARM companion only. Intel, Windows, audio listening and public release gates remain open.
